<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Assessment Invitation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f3f6fb;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a90e2, #0078d4);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 15px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .card {
      background: #f8fbff;
      border-left: 5px solid #0078d4;
      padding: 18px 25px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 6px 0;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      background-color: #0078d4;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      transition: background 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #005fa3;
    }

    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
      padding: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .note {
      background: #fdf8e4;
      border: 1px solid #f1e1a6;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>You're Invited to an Assessment!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Hi <strong><%= candidateName %></strong>,</p>

      <p>We’re excited to inform you that you’ve been selected to participate in the following assessment as part of our recruitment process. This is a great opportunity to demonstrate your skills and stand out!</p>

      <div class="card">
        <p><strong>Assessment Name:</strong> <%= assessmentName %></p>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> <%= duration %> minutes</p>
        <p><strong>Expiry Date:</strong> <%= expiryDate %></p>
      </div>

      <p>Please click the button below to start your assessment when you're ready:</p>

      <p style="text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;">
        <a href="<%= assessmentLink %>" class="btn">Start My Assessment</a>
      </p>

      <div class="note">
        <strong>Note:</strong> Make sure you have a stable internet connection and complete the assessment in one sitting. Once started, you may not be able to pause or resume later.
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">If you face any issues accessing the assessment, please reach out to your HR or recruiter for assistance.</p>

      <p>Best of luck! We’re looking forward to seeing your performance.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>© <%= currentYear %> <strong>YourCompany</strong>. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
